  "text": {
    "suptitle": "Pooled vs stratified Shapley decomposition",
    "fig_texts": [
      "114,980 features; 22 blocks after collapsing collinearity at |rho| >= 0.9  |  PROVISIONAL TARGET \u2014 #1738 SAE->SAE context arm; the full-width dense->SAE arrays (task #7, pod-1482 live) are not in yet. Re-renders on one --r2-npy swap.",
